    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Astrolabus</strong>, a heart-pounding first-person action-horror puzzle game set in the remote, unforgiving Alaskan wilderness. With no memories to guide you, you'll delve deep into a labyrinth of underground facilities, each hiding secrets more terrifying than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person action-horror gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/3247d09e0a8e47a51e19295209208cd0.poster.avif?t=1753011976\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/3247d09e0a8e47a51e19295209208cd0.webm?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/3247d09e0a8e47a51e19295209208cd0.mp4?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysterious past of the amnesiac protagonist,  as you explore a labyrinth of underground facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve mind-bending puzzles to progress deeper into the facility and unravel the horrifying secrets within</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/cbbfda035e44a0873bee41dd335b1398.poster.avif?t=1753011976\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/cbbfda035e44a0873bee41dd335b1398.webm?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/cbbfda035e44a0873bee41dd335b1398.mp4?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against the terrors that lurk in the darkness, using stealth, wits, and any tools you can scavenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/d7e28805150573a4057e191d32f3b052.poster.avif?t=1753011976\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/d7e28805150573a4057e191d32f3b052.webm?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/d7e28805150573a4057e191d32f3b052.mp4?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gripping narrative that blends science fiction and psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments and unsettling audio design create a tense, suspenseful atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/1f349f67fbd71ae430a0f13552d8eceb.poster.avif?t=1753011976\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/1f349f67fbd71ae430a0f13552d8eceb.webm?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/1f349f67fbd71ae430a0f13552d8eceb.mp4?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Astrolabus</strong>, a heart-pounding first-person action-horror puzzle game set in the remote, unforgiving Alaskan wilderness. With no memories to guide you, you'll delve deep into a labyrinth of underground facilities, each hiding secrets more terrifying than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person action-horror gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/3247d09e0a8e47a51e19295209208cd0.poster.avif?t=1753011976\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/3247d09e0a8e47a51e19295209208cd0.webm?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/3247d09e0a8e47a51e19295209208cd0.mp4?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysterious past of the amnesiac protagonist,  as you explore a labyrinth of underground facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve mind-bending puzzles to progress deeper into the facility and unravel the horrifying secrets within</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/cbbfda035e44a0873bee41dd335b1398.poster.avif?t=1753011976\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/cbbfda035e44a0873bee41dd335b1398.webm?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/cbbfda035e44a0873bee41dd335b1398.mp4?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against the terrors that lurk in the darkness, using stealth, wits, and any tools you can scavenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/d7e28805150573a4057e191d32f3b052.poster.avif?t=1753011976\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/d7e28805150573a4057e191d32f3b052.webm?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/d7e28805150573a4057e191d32f3b052.mp4?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gripping narrative that blends science fiction and psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments and unsettling audio design create a tense, suspenseful atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/1f349f67fbd71ae430a0f13552d8eceb.poster.avif?t=1753011976\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/1f349f67fbd71ae430a0f13552d8eceb.webm?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/1f349f67fbd71ae430a0f13552d8eceb.mp4?t=1753011976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
